{
  "title": "RemoteFM1",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "FM-1 firmwares run",
        "on the Move itself:",
        "three at once, each",
        "in its own slot.",
        "",
        "Play them from the",
        "pads, knobs and the",
        "sequencer.",
        "",
        "A phone or computer",
        "on the same Wi-Fi:",
        "remotefm1.local:7730",
        "shows the FM-1's",
        "screen, Mix & FX,",
        "the States and the",
        "projects (save,",
        "load, download,",
        "upload), files and",
        "more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Leaving",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + touch the",
        "volume knob + click",
        "the jog wheel.",
        "",
        "Move's own software",
        "starts again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Power",
      "lines": [
        "Press the power",
        "button: Shut Down?",
        "The jog click",
        "confirms (all is",
        "saved, then the",
        "Move turns off).",
        "",
        "Back, power again",
        "or any button,",
        "pad or step:",
        "cancel.",
        "",
        "Hold power 2 s:",
        "off at once."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "lines": [
        "RemoteFM1 speaks",
        "what the Move shows:",
        "modes, views, slots,",
        "firmwares, knobs",
        "and loads.",
        "",
        "Global Settings",
        "(Track 4 held +",
        "step 2) >",
        "Speech: Off, On, or",
        "Jog (only while you",
        "touch the jog).",
        "",
        "Voice, speed and",
        "volume are",
        "Schwung's settings.",
        "",
        "Global Settings >",
        "Exit (the last row):",
        "click, click again:",
        "leaves RemoteFM1."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Track Buttons",
      "lines": [
        "Track 1-3: the three",
        "firmware slots:",
        "orange, blue,",
        "yellow.",
        "Track 4: Mixer,",
        "Routing, Kit,",
        "Looper, projects.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: play",
        "that firmware in",
        "its own layout.",
        "Hold: its menu.",
        "Double tap: the",
        "firmware list;",
        "double tap a pad",
        "there to load it.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: Mixer,",
        "Routing, Kit,",
        "Looper in turn.",
        "Hold: pad 1 Mixer,",
        "2 Routing, 3 Kit,",
        "4 Looper, 5",
        "projects;",
        "steps the Shift",
        "shortcuts.",
        "Double: projects.",
        "",
        "Back closes menus.",
        "",
        "Hold Track 1-3: a",
        "step selects its",
        "track at once.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "Hold: its routing.",
        "A Track tap blinks",
        "the selected track",
        "on the steps.",
        "Hold Track + volume:",
        "the slot's level",
        "(100: 0 dB)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Layout Menu",
      "lines": [
        "Hold Track 1-3:",
        "top pads: FM-1,",
        "the firmware's own,",
        "Scale, Chroma,",
        "Drum, Octave;",
        "pad 8: latch.",
        "Other pads: scales.",
        "",
        "Steps: the tracks.",
        "Lit: reaches this",
        "firmware. Dark: not.",
        "Blinking: selected.",
        "Purple: solo.",
        "Click: select.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "Hold: routed / not.",
        "",
        "Jog: root.",
        "Up/Down: octave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FM-1 Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Playing",
          "lines": [
            "Pads are the FM-1's",
            "keys. Knob 1 SELECT,",
            "2 PRESET, 3 ALGO,",
            "5-8 the FM-1's",
            "knobs; its buttons.",
            "Volume is MASTER.",
            "",
            "Jog: SELECT; click",
            "for PRESET, ALGO.",
            "Up: the FM-1's SEQ"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Labels",
          "lines": [
            "Touch a knob: its",
            "name and value.",
            "",
            "Hold a button: what",
            "it does now.",
            "",
            "Touch the jog wheel",
            "and press buttons:",
            "each shows its",
            "label at once.",
            "",
            "Popup size: Global",
            "Settings, knob 4."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Firmwares",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "The Firmware View",
          "lines": [
            "Double tap Track",
            "1-3: its firmwares.",
            "Back: out again.",
            "",
            "Pads pick a firmware",
            "Jog press: load it",
            "Jog turn: its info",
            "Left/Right: banks",
            "Delete: unload"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lists & Filters",
          "lines": [
            "Step 1: Favorites",
            "Step 2: All",
            "Steps 3-7: category",
            "Steps 8-15: tags",
            "Step 13: Random, a",
            "firmware from the",
            "list (all banks).",
            "Step 16: Fantasy",
            "",
            "Sample: favorite",
            "Knob 1: pad colour"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Update",
          "lines": [
            "Mute: the catalog.",
            "Step 1: updates",
            "Step 2: not",
            " installed",
            "",
            "Jog press downloads",
            "(Wi-Fi), then loads",
            "it into the track."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switching Slots",
          "lines": [
            "Tap Track 1-3: play",
            "that slot.",
            "",
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "volume: that slot's",
            "level."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "States",
          "lines": [
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "pad 7 (top row), or",
            "Loop in the firmware",
            "list: the firmware's",
            "32 states.",
            "",
            "Pad 1 (white): this",
            "project's own sound,",
            "saved as you play.",
            "Click: save it.",
            "",
            "Pads 2-32: a library",
            "all projects share.",
            "Click a stored one:",
            "load it into the",
            "project. An empty",
            "one: save the sound.",
            "Playing never",
            "changes a library",
            "state.",
            "",
            "Hold a pad + Delete:",
            "reset it (as first",
            "installed).",
            "",
            "Copy + pad: copy;",
            "then Copy + another",
            "pad: paste there.",
            "Copy + pad 1: copy",
            "the sound now.",
            "Delete + pad: cut.",
            "",
            "Step 14: New, the",
            "firmware as first",
            "installed.",
            "Undo: the sound",
            "before the last",
            "load, paste or New.",
            "",
            "Back: leave."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX & Mix",
      "lines": [
        "Your Schwung MIDI FX",
        "and audio FX run",
        "inside RemoteFM1.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: the",
        "Mixer; again:",
        "Routing (FX pages).",
        "",
        "Hold an FX pad and",
        "turn the jog: pick",
        "a module. Jog click:",
        "its pages. Back:",
        "out of the pages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Note Layouts",
      "lines": [
        "Scale, Chroma, Drum",
        "and Octave are the",
        "sequencer: pads play",
        "the selected track,",
        "steps are its steps,",
        "knobs: trigs first.",
        "",
        "Menu: session view.",
        "Play: the sequencer",
        "and clock to every",
        "firmware."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer",
      "lines": [
        "16 tracks, each on",
        "its own MIDI",
        "channel, like Move's",
        "own sequencer.",
        "",
        "A note layout plays",
        "the track selected",
        "for that firmware.",
        "",
        "Sync: INT by",
        "default.",
        "",
        "Loop, Mute: a quick",
        "click sticks, a",
        "hold is momentary.",
        "Copy, Delete: hold",
        "them.",
        "Delete + Play:",
        "clear the clip.",
        "Delete + touch a",
        "knob: its locks on",
        "every step gone.",
        "Hold a step, touch",
        "a knob, Delete:",
        "that step's lock.",
        "Shift + Loop: Fill.",
        "",
        "A Shift menu stays",
        "until Back. Touch a",
        "knob: its name on",
        "top.",
        "",
        "Jog: knob pages.",
        "TRIG, FM-1, ENGINE,",
        "then the CC banks.",
        "ENGINE: the",
        "firmware's own",
        "sound parameters",
        "(ChoralRoot).",
        "Jog click there:",
        "its list of pages.",
        "FM-1 page: knobs",
        "are the firmware's.",
        "Jog click there:",
        "Knobs + Keys. Steps",
        "and buttons go to",
        "the firmware too.",
        "Pads stay notes.",
        "The jog turns Select",
        "(its knob is white).",
        "Play is the",
        "firmware's Play;",
        "Back + Play: the",
        "Move's Play.",
        "Jog click or Back:",
        "the knob lock ends.",
        "It ends too when you",
        "change mode, track",
        "or view.",
        "Shift + jog click:",
        "what the jog turns:",
        "Select, Preset or",
        "Algo, as in the",
        "FM-1 layout.",
        "",
        "Shift + an FM-1 knob",
        "in Knobs: the",
        "firmware's shifted",
        "turn (its engine).",
        "",
        "Each track keeps",
        "its knob page.",
        "Shift + Track 1-3:",
        "its track settings:",
        "Rate (1/32 to 4",
        "Bars) and Feel:",
        "Straight, Dotted,",
        "Triplet (every",
        "fourth step off).",
        "",
        "Global settings,",
        "FW Play: Both: the",
        "firmware's Play",
        "plays the Move too.",
        "",
        "Loop page:",
        "Jog: loop length.",
        "The steps show the",
        "last bar's steps.",
        "Two lower pad rows:",
        "last bar's length,",
        "1-16 steps.",
        "Hold a bar + jog:",
        "its notes' length.",
        "Double click a bar:",
        "loop it alone.",
        "Hold a bar + press",
        "another: the range.",
        "",
        "Shift menus:",
        "Jog picks a value.",
        "Jog click edits it.",
        "Click again: done.",
        "Knobs work as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Back Shortcuts",
      "lines": [
        "Hold Back, then:",
        "Left: bar 1, or",
        "track 1 in session.",
        "Up: scene 1 in",
        "session view.",
        "Loop: the loop is",
        "the whole clip.",
        "Play: to bar 1.",
        "Where Play is the",
        "firmware's: the",
        "Move's Play.",
        "Delete: close every",
        "open layer.",
        "A quick Back click",
        "closes one layer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Session View",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + Menu in a",
        "note layout. Track",
        "held + Menu in the",
        "FM-1 layout. Back +",
        "Menu anywhere.",
        "Menu: back out.",
        "",
        "Pad columns 1-7 are",
        "tracks, the 8th",
        "launches scenes.",
        "A column has its",
        "slot's colour.",
        "Grey: no slot.",
        "Dim: not reaching",
        "the firmware played.",
        "",
        "Press a clip: plays",
        "at the next bar.",
        "Double click: now.",
        "Green: playing.",
        "White: selected.",
        "Flashing: waiting,",
        "or about to stop.",
        "Empty slot: selects",
        "it, stops the track.",
        "Shift + slot: select",
        "only.",
        "",
        "Scene pad: plays the",
        "row, also from stop.",
        "Double click: now.",
        "Shift + scene: stop.",
        "",
        "Steps: odd selects",
        "the track above,",
        "even stops it.",
        "Step 16: stop all.",
        "Hold an odd step:",
        "knob 1 Launch,",
        "knob 2 After,",
        "volume the level.",
        "",
        "Shift + arrows: a",
        "page.",
        "",
        "Touch a knob: its",
        "track's info. Knob",
        "8: the scenes.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: that",
        "firmware plays.",
        "Hold Track 1-3: pads",
        "route a column.",
        "Click: on / off.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "",
        "Hold Delete + clip:",
        "deleted, kept in",
        "the buffer.",
        "Hold Copy + clip:",
        "copied. Empty slot:",
        "pasted. After a",
        "copy or a delete a",
        "clip is replaced.",
        "Scene pads: the",
        "same for a row.",
        "Delete + Play:",
        "clear the clip.",
        "",
        "Global settings,",
        "Launch: when clips",
        "start.",
        "",
        "Double click the",
        "playing clip: it",
        "stops now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sampler",
      "lines": [
        "Sample opens the",
        "sampler. In it,",
        "Sample records.",
        "In FM-1 mode: hold",
        "a Track + Sample.",
        "",
        "Track 1-3 held +",
        "Sample: that",
        "firmware is the",
        "source. Track 4",
        "held + Sample: the",
        "master.",
        "",
        "The jog picks a",
        "setting; its click",
        "changes it: Source,",
        "Mode, Length,",
        "Threshold, Input",
        "level.",
        "",
        "Bars, stopped:",
        "Sample arms it,",
        "Play starts the",
        "take.",
        "",
        "Back closes it; a",
        "take goes on.",
        "Sample then brings",
        "it back and ends",
        "the take.",
        "",
        "Takes go to the",
        "Samples library:",
        "RemoteFM1, a folder",
        "a day. Stems: a",
        "folder a take.",
        "Firmwares and the",
        "page see them in",
        "audio/rec.",
        "",
        "Tabs: Record,",
        "Takes, Tools. Up",
        "past the first row,",
        "click, turn, click.",
        "",
        "Takes: all of them,",
        "the newest on top.",
        "Click a take: Play,",
        "the tools, To Kit,",
        "Delete.",
        "Delete held + click",
        "deletes. Undo: back.",
        "",
        "Outside Record,",
        "Sample plays the",
        "take. Back: the",
        "tabs, then out.",
        "",
        "Trim: knob 1 the",
        "start, knob 2 the",
        "end; Shift: fine.",
        "Keep cuts the file.",
        "",
        "Tools: Trim,",
        "Normalize, Reverse,",
        "Fade in, Fade out.",
        "",
        "After a Capture its",
        "take plays; after",
        "Manual or Threshold",
        "Trim comes up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Kit",
      "lines": [
        "Track 4's third",
        "view: 16 sampled",
        "pads on tracks",
        "13-16 (a row a",
        "track). Hold Track",
        "4 + pad 3.",
        "",
        "Left pads: the kit,",
        "pad 1 bottom left.",
        "A press plays and",
        "picks the pad.",
        "Shift + pad: picks",
        "it silently.",
        "",
        "Right pads (Sample",
        "Kit knob 1):",
        "Pitches, In Key (16",
        "scale notes),",
        "Chromatic or In Key",
        "4ths (rows a fourth",
        "apart), Chop (the",
        "region in 16 chops,",
        "top left first;",
        "hold two: loop the",
        "range).",
        "",
        "Steps: the picked",
        "pad's notes, bright",
        "as hard. A tapped",
        "step: a plain hit",
        "(a step long, 100 %",
        "chance, no locks).",
        "Hold a step + pads:",
        "theirs in or out.",
        "Hold a step + the",
        "volume knob: its",
        "velocity (not the",
        "master);",
        "+ a yellow knob:",
        "that hit's own",
        "value (a lock; the",
        "step blinks).",
        "Delete + touch a",
        "knob: the pad's",
        "locks of it gone",
        "(Sample Kit, Kit",
        "Mix: every pad's",
        "locks).",
        "Delete + Play: the",
        "pad's steps (Sample",
        "Kit, Kit Mix: all",
        "16 pads'). Undo:",
        "back.",
        "Hold a step, touch",
        "a knob, Delete:",
        "that step's lock.",
        "A held step's knob:",
        "a padlock when",
        "locked, else the",
        "pad's own value",
        "dimmed.",
        "Hold a step + jog:",
        "its length (Shift:",
        "whole steps). + Left",
        "/ Right: its timing",
        "(Shift: finer).",
        "",
        "Jog: turns the",
        "pages (their icons",
        "show a moment). A",
        "page is a picture;",
        "touch a knob to see",
        "its value.",
        "Shift + a knob:",
        "fine.",
        "",
        "Sample Kit: every",
        "pad's steps; 1 the",
        "right pads, 2 trim",
        "silence.",
        "Pad Sample: 1",
        "start, 2 end (a",
        "close view; Shift:",
        "nearer and fine), 3",
        "transpose (Shift:",
        "cents), 4 engine",
        "(One Shot,",
        "Momentary, Loop,",
        "Pitch Env, LoFi,",
        "Granular), 5-8 the",
        "engine's own.",
        "Trig: as a track's",
        "TRIG page, for a",
        "held step (none",
        "held: dark); a trig",
        "on a step is for",
        "every pad's hit.",
        "Pad Sample 2: 1-4",
        "attack, decay,",
        "sustain, release,",
        "5-6 the engine's",
        "further, 7 choke, 8",
        "reverse.",
        "Engines' own: Loop:",
        "loop start, end,",
        "fade; Pitch Env:",
        "depth, attack,",
        "release; LoFi:",
        "bits 1.0-24.0,",
        "rate; Granular:",
        "position, scan",
        "(moves it on,",
        "wrapping), size,",
        "density, spray,",
        "spread.",
        "Warp: 1 Off,",
        "Repitch, Grains or",
        "Beats, 2 sync",
        "(steps), 3 speed, 4",
        "pitch, 5-6 grain,",
        "jitter or search.",
        "Repitch + sync: the",
        "fit sets the pitch.",
        "Filter: 1 cutoff, 2",
        "resonance, 3 morph",
        "(LP, BP, HP), 4 env",
        "amount, 5-8 its",
        "envelope.",
        "Pad Mix: 1 level,",
        "2 pan, 3 cutoff,",
        "5-7 sends.",
        "Kit Mix: the kit's",
        "level, pan, cutoff,",
        "resonance, sends.",
        "",
        "Jog click: the",
        "browser, on the",
        "picked pad's sound",
        "(Takes, Samples,",
        "Kits; Back on top",
        "goes up). Rest the",
        "jog on a sound: it",
        "is on the pad; tap",
        "the pad to hear it.",
        "A pad pressed: the",
        "one to fill. Click",
        "a sound or press",
        "Back to leave: it",
        "stays. Undo: the",
        "sound before you",
        "browsed. Shift +",
        "click on a folder:",
        "All To Pads.",
        "",
        "On Sample Kit or",
        "Kit Mix the click:",
        "Load, Save (Kit 1,",
        "Kit 2 ..).",
        "",
        "Mixer: knob 4 and",
        "column 4 the kit.",
        "",
        "Hold a pad +",
        "Sample: record into",
        "it until you let",
        "go.",
        "",
        "Delete + pad: its",
        "steps, then its",
        "sound. Mute + pad:",
        "muted. Undo: back.",
        "",
        "Hold Copy: turn the",
        "jog for Copy, Mix",
        "or Join; a pad, then",
        "pads to put it on",
        "(at once; an empty",
        "pad: a copy). Each",
        "press starts on",
        "Copy.",
        "",
        "A kept sound is the",
        "project's own copy",
        "(Kits/Projects):",
        "edits never change",
        "the original. Files",
        "opens a pad's sound",
        "where it came from",
        "(a saved kit's too;",
        "gone: the kit's",
        "file, then the",
        "copy).",
        "Shift + step 3 on a",
        "kit track: Export",
        "Samples (the jog's",
        "last row, click):",
        "the pads' sounds",
        "into a new folder",
        "of Samples, named",
        "by the kit (else",
        "the project), a",
        "file a pad (\"01",
        "Kick.wav\").",
        "",
        "A sampler take:",
        "To Kit, then a pad",
        "or Slice: knobs 1-2",
        "the cut, knob 3 the",
        "hits' sensitivity,",
        "click puts the",
        "slices on pads.",
        "Slice by Tap: a",
        "step plays the take,",
        "each further step a",
        "cut where you hear",
        "it; Delete + step:",
        "cuts cleared.",
        "Sampler To Kit:",
        "each take onto the",
        "next empty pad.",
        "Source Kit: the",
        "kit alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Looper",
      "lines": [
        "Track 4's fourth",
        "view: an audio",
        "looper, 4 lanes (pad",
        "rows, lane 1 on top)",
        "x 8 scenes",
        "(columns). Hold",
        "Track 4 + pad 4.",
        "",
        "Tap an empty pad: it",
        "records from the",
        "next bar (stopped:",
        "armed, Play starts",
        "it). Tap the red pad",
        "or Sample: it ends",
        "at the next bar and",
        "plays at once.",
        "Record page: each",
        "lane's Source",
        "(Played, Track 1-3,",
        "Kit, Input, Mix,",
        "Loops) and Length",
        "(Open, 1-16 bars).",
        "Hold a pad + Sample:",
        "record over it.",
        "",
        "Tap a loop: it plays",
        "at the next bar (the",
        "Launch setting); a",
        "playing one: stops.",
        "Double tap: now.",
        "A lane plays one",
        "loop at a time.",
        "",
        "Scenes: the left",
        "step under a column,",
        "Shift + any pad of",
        "the column, or slide",
        "a finger down it.",
        "Step 16: stop all.",
        "Stopped: a scene",
        "starts Play.",
        "",
        "Pick a slot without",
        "playing it: hold",
        "Loop + its pad, or",
        "the arrows.",
        "",
        "Jog: the pages.",
        "Loops: the lanes",
        "(knobs: their",
        "levels). Loop: 1",
        "start, 2 length, 3",
        "pitch (Shift:",
        "cents), 4 reverse,",
        "5 warp (Repitch:",
        "follows the tempo;",
        "Off: its own rate).",
        "Record. Loop Mix:",
        "level, pan, sends,",
        "mute. Looper Mix:",
        "lanes, the Loops",
        "strip.",
        "",
        "Hold a pad + the",
        "volume knob: its",
        "level. Hold Track 4",
        "+ volume: the Loops",
        "strip (also the",
        "Mixer's knob 5).",
        "",
        "Copy + a loop, then",
        "pads: copies.",
        "Delete + a loop (or",
        "a scene's step):",
        "gone. Mute + a loop.",
        "Undo: one step.",
        "",
        "Loops are kept with",
        "the project",
        "(Samples/RemoteFM1/",
        "Kits/Projects/NN/",
        "Loops). The",
        "sampler's Loops tab:",
        "the jog picks a",
        "slot, its click",
        "records / plays /",
        "stops; the pads",
        "stay the firmware's."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Projects",
      "lines": [
        "Track 4 double tap",
        "(or held + step 1):",
        "the 32 projects.",
        "",
        "A project keeps its",
        "three firmwares and",
        "their sounds:",
        "opening it loads",
        "them as you left",
